# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18513
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_8a890b27:

    "{cps=50}你从城墙上摔回壕沟，竟奇迹般地没有当场摔死。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}脑震荡！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18518
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_78b6504f:

    "{cps=50}你从城墙上摔回壕沟，竟奇迹般地没有当场摔死。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}生命值降低5！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18520
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_fdd0f7c2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}攻城以失败告终。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18522
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_40a40636:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}队伍损失大半，你也遍体鳞伤，接下来整整两周都在舔舐伤口。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18524
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_47979a4b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}平心而论，伯爵还算厚道，没有派你们的人去干任何劳役或差事，好让你们稍作休整。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}疲劳解除！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18527
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_e399d31e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而恰好两周之后，围城营地一有新的补充兵力抵达，新一轮攻城便立刻张罗起来。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18529
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_b287c3b8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这一次，交给你们的任务是经由河畔的下水道地宫潜入城内。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18531
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_a0b8b6fe:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等到冲向城墙的攻城队将守军的注意力尽数吸引过去，你带着一小队士兵拨开河边的芦苇，摸到通向城内地宫的狭窄入口，一头扎进那股腐臭之中……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18535
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_2_postfight_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

