    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:18998
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_42b7202b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}推进颇为顺利，你们几乎就要抵达通往城下区的出口……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19000
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_6821875a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而眼见你们占了上风，守军先是用石块堵死通向城内的出口，接着又灌入浓烟，呛得你们喘不过气，也无法清理障碍。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19002
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_74ec23cf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你们只得撤退。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19004
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_46176944:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}营地照例给了你们大约两周的休整时间。此间，城里被源源不断地抛进牲畜尸体，弩炮与投石机发射的燃烧弹四处引发大火。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19006
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_fe8d7309:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}但与最重要的事相比，这些都微不足道——工匠们终于造好了几座攻城塔。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19008
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_88389b73:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}新的补充兵力一到营地，伯爵便照例立刻宣布再次攻城。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}疲劳程度降低。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19011
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_ca9d84e7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这台刀箭不侵的攻城机器稳妥地把你们送到城墙根下，你们第三次尝试夺取这座城市……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:19015
translate chinese duncan_in_windsor_3_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

