# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:22896
translate chinese canterbury_battle_for_london_2_postfight_f3734da0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}敌人拦不住你们，开始溃退，阵形支离破碎。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:22898
translate chinese canterbury_battle_for_london_2_postfight_5bf6233f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}胜利的味道让你追了上去，任由自己的阵形也随之散乱。而这，铸成大错。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:22900
translate chinese canterbury_battle_for_london_2_postfight_09daa3c0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}溃退的敌兵身后，又出现了一个新的阵列——这一次，是身披金银纹饰重甲的骑士。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:22902
translate chinese canterbury_battle_for_london_2_postfight_f177845a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们冲锋的全部力量，尽数砸向你。"

