# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30448
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_3710f375:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你又是一记重拳，鲁芬栽倒在地。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30450
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_0d30ab0d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这名雇佣兵挣扎着想要起身，可遍体鳞伤的身体不听使唤，他拼尽全力也只是勉强撑起一点……随即便再次倒下。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30452
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_eaabc146:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}无数道血溪从他身下蜿蜒而出，汇成小河与小洼——毫无疑问，他再也站不起来了。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30454
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_0b1e482f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}明白一切都已结束，鲁芬长出一口气。{vspace=5}{w}那气息，仿佛一个久负重担的旅人终于卸下肩上沉甸甸的行李，彻底松弛下来。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30456
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_b5cda0e8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然后，他闭上了眼睛。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30458
translate chinese canterbury_ruffin_showdown_postfight_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30476
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_390b2497:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}前往郡长府邸的一路平安无事。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30478
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30484
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_367889cd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你向守卫队长亮出一袋鼓囊囊的弗罗林，立刻便获准面见郡长。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30486
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_f89eb6b3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尽管你满怀着整整一袋子的致谢之意，这场会面却谈不上友好。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30488
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_1f5f93f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}郡长一把夺过钱袋，粗声宣布：从今往后，他的眷顾要价翻倍。此外，他还明令邓肯及其手下，任何重大行动，事先必须征得他的准许。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30490
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_2e3ac096:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}尤其不得袭扰任何领主的庄园或其属民。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30492
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_dddfeacd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回去后，你将郡长的话转告邓肯，他却一挥手，说郡长的庇护只在队伍还是一撮在自己眼皮底下打游击的乌合之众时才有价值。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30494
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_66fa0cee:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今队伍已是更强悍的作战力量，又打算移师奇彭纳姆，格林威治郡长的这点用处，也就到此为止了。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30496
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_b577ce99:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}获得50弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:30502
translate chinese secret_ingredient_1_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

