    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32757
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_hub_33898b69:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}损失45弗罗林。{vspace=5}时间损失：1。{vspace=5}疲劳程度下降！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32763
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_hub_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32791
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_null_2b6d58eb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在酒馆里吃喝消遣的这段时间，并无值得留意之事发生。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32793
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_null_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32799
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_ff53d859:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在酒馆喝酒时，你不巧与几个形迹可疑的人同桌——从言谈听来，他们该是走私贩子。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32801
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32803
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_41a52f15:

    "{cps=50}你不愿与这些人厮混，起身离去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}低虔诚——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32805
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_faad89a8:

    "{cps=50}你自己也是个屡屡游走在律法之外的人，与他们一拍即合。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}低虔诚——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32806
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_3f8da0af:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这几位新相识的“营生”范围颇广：不仅贩运私酒，还在附近林子里偷猎野味，有时甚至顺手牵羊，偷些梅德斯通药剂师在自家田地上栽种的炼金药材。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32808
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_0eaf91b8:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这些东西，他们都愿意以公道的价钱出手给你。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32811
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32813
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_smugglers_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32819
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_9877e32c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在酒馆喝酒时，你不巧与几个刚从战场归来的退伍老兵凑到了一桌。他们正盘算着一件不小的事——合开一家带客栈的酒馆。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32821
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_dee9fc35:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}周密的计划与各路门路，他们早已备齐，如今只差一件事——凑齐启动的本钱。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32823
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_d83620db:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}虽说手头有些积蓄，钱却仍然不够。因此，为凑足所需数目，他们正在寻一位肯出好价钱的主顾，收购他们从法兰西远征中带回来的剩余军备。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32825
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_e9d181ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说你有兴趣，他们便邀你上门一观，看看货色。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32827
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_013841b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过他们也提醒你莫要拖延太久——觊觎这批货的人，可不只你一个。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32829
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_exsoldiers_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32835
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_4c0a9fb4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}在酒馆喝酒时，你不经意间听到两个酒友的一段闲谈——说的是城西北河上那座桥坍塌的事。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32837
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_e6450310:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}据他们说，那座年久失修的老桥早就该修了，可桥所在的领地主家却死活不肯掏这笔钱。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32839
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_32bdf2d3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这般做派自有其道理：在领主看来，桥之所以磨损不堪，全怪那些络绎不绝的商人——不是赶去梅德斯通，便是从那里动身北上。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32841
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_84c4aa43:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这些商人让城里的税关与商税进账丰厚——而领主从他们身上，却只捞到一笔象征性的过境费。这笔钱还要全数花在自家身上：养活自己、家眷与一大帮亲戚，供养骑士队、一班子流动艺人，还有整整一马厩从意大利运来的纯血良驹。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32843
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_63ac394f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}所以，还是照领主大人的逻辑，这座被满载货物的大车压得散架的桥，理应由梅德斯通出资修缮——毕竟每一辆货车都为本就殷实的城库添进一把金币。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32845
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_81cf7642:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}城里自然一个子儿也不肯掏，这桩公案已扯皮了不止一年。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32847
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_1e5ad765:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}结果就在前几天，当领主亲自前往梅德斯通面见城守时，那座桥终于不堪重负……在领主带着随从过桥的当口轰然垮塌。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32849
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_7d27de7f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}无人生还。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32851
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_5017e810:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}如今四乡八里的人都涌到河上，拼命打捞领主及其随从落入河底的各式装备。难处在于：这一段河道格外深，潜到河底谈何容易，所以大部分值钱物什至今仍无人捞得。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32853
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_b15e6f15:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}话说到此便断了——那两人喝干杯中麦酒，起身出门，到街上接着聊去了。不过，你该听的已经全听到了。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32855
translate chinese maidstone_tavern_bridge_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32881
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_trade_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32887
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_f98b7b09:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}一队城中卫兵忽然冲进走私贩的藏身处，不由分说便开始拘拿在场诸人。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32889
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32891
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_490e38e6:

    "{cps=50}你拼死一搏，赶在最后一刻逃脱了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——成功！{vspace=5}疲劳程度上升！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32893
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32897
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_19dacd39:

    "{cps=50}你试图逃跑，却未能得逞。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}敏捷、协调——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32899
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_7189999a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因与走私贩勾结，你被处以两百五十弗罗林的罚金。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32902
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_f0de0a9f:

    nvl clear
    "{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}损失250弗罗林！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32905
translate chinese maidstone_smugglers_police_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32909
