# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32933
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_53374952:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}赶到断桥残骸处环视一番，你很快确认：这一段河水确实深得惊人，潜到河底是件极冒险的事。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32935
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32937
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_4ade8e89:

    "{cps=50}一个有趣的念头浮上心头……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}低虔诚——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32938
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_e6d405b1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}既然自己下不到河底，何不就近藏进灌木丛里，等别人替你捞呢……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32940
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_aa582d5c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然后走出藏身处，向那位可怜人提出一个他无法拒绝的提议。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32942
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32945
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_48de3ee0:

    "{cps=50}掂量过自己的本事，你决定冒一次险，潜下去碰碰运气。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32946
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32948
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_1055fab1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}然而你这点有限的耐力，也只够潜下很短的一段距离。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力——失败！{vspace=5}疲劳程度上升。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32951
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_67d7f9d9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}确认无论怎样都够不到河底，你只得浮了回去。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：1。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32954
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32958
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_569dde81:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}凭着过人的耐力，你屏息良久，终于触到河底……{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力——成功！{vspace=5}疲劳程度上升。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32961
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_b996cdf4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可深水处一片漆黑，河底又覆着淤泥，想找点什么难如登天。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32963
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_c9a07e05:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}若真想带着收获浮上水面，你只能靠双手在水里一寸寸摸索。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32965
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_4583b076:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而肺里的空气，此刻已所剩无几……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32967
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32973
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_44db52e2:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}窒息的感觉，正开始隐隐作祟……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32975
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_e2890486:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}疲劳程度上升！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32978
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32983
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_042cd8a9:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}耐力降低[storyroll]！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32987
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_2a17dde1:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}协调降低[storyroll]！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32991
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_5bb162bb:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}生命值降低[storyroll]！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32993
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32996
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_a80d4558:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}身体已逼近极限，你决定上浮。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:32998
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33010
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_618a39f5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你还真摸到了点东西！{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调、幸运——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33013
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33016
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_c8e524f1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在水底摸索良久，却一无所获。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}协调、幸运——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33018
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_menu_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33023
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_f87031b1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你平安回到岸上，略作晾晒，便返回城里。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33027
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33031
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_79d143c9:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}可你刚离开断桥残骸两步，近旁的灌木丛里便跳出几个手持兵刃、面目不善的汉子。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33033
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_4a284e21:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他们团团围住你，勒令交出从河底捞到的所有物什，并许诺：只要你照办，便不为难你。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33035
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_4:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33038
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33040
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_be311c69:

    "{cps=50}你依言而行，把全部所得交给了他们。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33041
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_55420100:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}拿到想要的东西，他们便不再理会你。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33043
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_65b43a4b:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你只得两手空空地回家。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33045
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33050
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_50bb9899:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你无意向这些强人低头，拔出了武器……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33054
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33059
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_9049b71a:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}为这点渺茫的指望搭上性命与健康，实在不值——你决定就此收手。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33061
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_4130f4cb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你平安上岸，返回城里。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：2！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33064
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_5:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33069
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_6251e22f:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}这个主意正合你意——你在近旁的灌木丛里寻了个舒服的位置，静候猎物上门。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：2！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33072
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_6:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33078
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_72152158:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在埋伏点守了几个时辰，直到午后，好运终于降临。一个背麻袋的农民出现在断桥边，几次潜下水去，每次都抱着满怀的物什浮上来。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33080
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_723c7ab4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}等到他把麻袋装得满满当当、转身要走时，你才走出藏身处，亮出兵器，逼那可怜人交出袋子。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33084
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_e5306c6e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}那农民吓得魂飞魄散，不敢多问一句，丢下袋子便狂奔而去。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33087
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_10:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33090
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_cbcea642:

    "{cps=50}你不想留下目击者，追上那农民，将他杀了。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚降低75！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33092
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_7:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33096
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_3263f809:

    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}虔诚上限降低[player_virtue_penalty]！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33097
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33102
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_f63981d1:

    "{cps=50}你没有追上去。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33103
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_9:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33105
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_b19c940c:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}回到家中，你终于得空细细检视从河底捞上来的物件。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33107
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_11:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33111
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_ae6106b5:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你在埋伏点守了整整一天，却连个人影也没等到。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}时间损失：4！{vspace=5}疲劳程度上升！{vspace=5}幸运——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33115
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_d22b34c3:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}太阳缓缓沉向地平线，又饥又累的你决定打道回府。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33117
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_12:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33122
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_1e720d55:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}再一琢磨，你认定此地没什么可指望的，便折返回去了。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33124
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_action_end_76b2fe88_13:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33130
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_e46083bf:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}某日白天，你无意间来到上城，瞥见市政厅墙上张贴的通缉犯画像——赫然发现其中一张与你颇为相像。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33132
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_63bbd1a0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}而其被通缉的罪名是……在梅德斯通西北旧桥残骸处犯下的一桩抢劫案。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33134
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_76b2fe88_8:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33136
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_b022cee4:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巧的是，恰在这时，一队卫兵从旁经过，也注意到了画像上的人与你的几分相似。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33138
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_516ac9b1:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}不过你这副正派体面的模样，足以打消一切疑虑——卫兵只是好心地建议你稍作改扮，比如蓄起胡须或把头发剪短，免得再撞脸惹麻烦。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33140
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33144
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_c81286d7:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}巧的是，恰在这时，一队卫兵从旁经过，也一眼看出你与画像上的人惊人地相像，当即将你拿下。{vspace=5}{color=#A9A9A9}威望——失败！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33146
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_b9def5fb:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}接下来的一昼夜你都在羁押中度过，随后被带到那个曾在断桥残骸处遭你埋伏抢劫的农民面前。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:33148
translate chinese maidstone_bridge_police_f630ade0:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}他自然一眼认出了你，城中的官署便以抢劫罪对你正式提起控诉。"

