# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34259
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_25303489:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}要踏进像样的场子，先得有身像样的行头。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——失败（要求：50）！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34261
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_76b2fe88:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34265
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_d4c9e912:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}你不费力便找到了那家铺子，向主人报上名号。可还没等你开口问事，他便先堵了话头：手头的订单已排到数月之后，不把现下的忙完，不打算接新的。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34267
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_631546ef:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}听说是谁举荐的你，老板不由仔细打量了你一番……"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34269
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_76b2fe88_2:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34272
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_dc3d7f20:

    "{cps=50}……可随后他又摇了摇头，歉意地重复了拒绝的话。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——彻底失败（要求：60）！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34274
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_76b2fe88_1:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34278
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_11f7deb2:

    "{cps=50}……他沉吟良久，终于开口：可以设法为你挤出些时间，但这活儿得按双倍工钱来算。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——结果平平（要求：70）！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34283
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_99cbe34a:

    "{cps=50}他上下挑剔地打量你一遍，点了点头，说愿意为一位体面人破例。{color=#A9A9A9}{vspace=5}威望——成功！"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34288
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_76b2fe88_3:

    nvl clear
    ""

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34290
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_1d755997:

    "{cps=50}接下订单之前，铁匠还告诉你：眼下议会与王子开战正酣，加之坎特伯雷伯爵铺开规模空前的军购，王国整个南方都在闹铠甲兵刃材料的紧缺。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34292
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_e546bee2:

    "{cps=50}接下订单之前，铁匠还告诉你：眼下苏格兰人入侵在即，加之坎特伯雷伯爵铺开规模空前的军购，王国整个南方都在闹铠甲兵刃材料的紧缺。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34294
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_e6476ce0:

    "{cps=50}接下订单之前，铁匠还告诉你：因坎特伯雷伯爵铺开规模空前的军购，王国整个南方都在闹铠甲兵刃材料的紧缺。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34295
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_1e2c1914:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}料也好，货也罢，全被人抢购、预定、付清货款，排到了好几个月之后。"

# game/script_dlc_2.rpy:34297
translate chinese london_blacksmith_shop_intro_6ac22391:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}因此，无论你想打造什么，不但要付足工钱，还得自备全部所需材料。"

